# CSS structure

| What you are adding | Where it goes |
|---------------------|---------------|
| Color, type size, space, duration | `tokens.css` as `--color-*`, `--type-*`, `--space-*`, `--dur-*` |
| Pattern on many pages (`.btn`, `.site-shell`, `.prose`, header, footer) | `global.css` |
| Layout and look for one component | That component’s `<style>` (scoped at build time; no extra request) |

```css
/* tokens.css — name the value once */
--space-4: 1.5rem;

/* global.css — shared button */
.btn--ink { background: var(--color-ink); }

/* Hero.astro <style> — only this hero */
.hero__brand { font-size: var(--type-brand); }
```

Naming: `block__element` and `block--modifier` (`.btn`, `.btn--ink`). Keep selectors shallow: one class, or class plus `:hover` / `:focus-visible`. No `!important`, no deep nesting, no raw hex when a token exists. Motion: `transform` and `opacity` with `var(--dur-*)` and `var(--ease-*)`.
